---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="推广与返利 (Affiliate Disclosure) | 机场狗"
  description="了解机场狗（JiChangDog）的推广与返利声明。我们承诺返利链接通常不会影响我们的客观评测与排名标准。"
>
  <article class="page-shell knowledge-layout">
    <div class="article-content prose">
      <div class="document-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">透明度声明</p>
        <h1>推广与返利 (Affiliate Disclosure)</h1>
        <p class="lead-paragraph">本站部分链接包含推荐返利（Affiliate），您的购买可能会为本站带来少量佣金，用于维持高价的服务器与评测线路开销，但这<strong>通常不会影响</strong>我们的客观评测与排名标准。</p>
      </div>

      <h2 id="what-is-affiliate">什么是推荐返利？</h2>
      <p>当您点击本站提供的一些机场链接并完成购买时，服务商可能会支付给我们一定比例的佣金。这通常被称为推广返利（Affiliate Marketing）。<strong>这不会增加您购买套餐的任何成本</strong>，在某些情况下，通过本站的专属链接，您甚至还能获得额外的折扣。</p>

      <h2 id="our-promise">我们的承诺：独立与客观</h2>
      <p>在机场狗（JiChangDog），我们将用户的信任放在首位：</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>不买榜：</strong> 我们拒绝任何形式的“付费排名”。机场在推荐列表中的位置完全取决于其在实际网络测试中的表现。</li>
        <li><strong>优胜劣汰：</strong> 如果一家机场的线路质量下降或有跑路风险，即使它的返利比例再高，我们也会谨慎评估后地将其移出推荐列表或加入黑名单。</li>
        <li><strong>数据真实：</strong> 所有测速数据和流媒体解锁情况均基于我们的实测，不受服务商的干预。</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="why-use-affiliate">为什么我们需要返利？</h2>
      <p>为了保持评测的独立性，我们采用自费购买套餐的方式进行测试。同时，搭建和维护这个网站、租用各地测试服务器都需要不小的开销。返利收入是我们维持网站运营、持续为您提供评测内容的唯一经济来源。</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="toc-sidebar">
      <div class="toc-container">
        <h3 class="toc-title">本文目录</h3>
        <ul id="toc-list" class="toc-list">
          <!-- JS will populate this -->
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .knowledge-layout {
    display: flex !important;
    flex-direction: row !important;
    gap: 40px;
    padding-top: 80px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .article-content {
    flex: 1 1 0%;
    min-width: 0;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }
  
  .document-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .document-header .eyebrow {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .document-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  
  .prose .lead-paragraph {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #374151;
    background: #f0fdf4;
    border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-top: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #eff4ff;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .prose h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #1f2937;
    margin-top: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .prose p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4b5563;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .prose a {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .prose a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .prose ul, .prose ol {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }
  .prose ul li, .prose ol li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #4b5563;
  }
  
  /* TOC Sidebar Styles */
  .toc-sidebar {
    width: 280px !important;
    flex-shrink: 0 !important;
    position: sticky !important;
    top: 100px !important;
  }
  .toc-container {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 24px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }
  .toc-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .toc-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .toc-link {
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    display: block;
    line-height: 1.4;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    padding-left: 10px;
    margin-left: 2px;
  }
  .toc-link:hover, .toc-link.active {
    color: var(--blue) !important;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-left-color: var(--blue) !important;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .knowledge-layout {
      flex-direction: column !important;
    }
    .toc-sidebar {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .article-content {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .document-header h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const content = document.querySelector('.article-content');
    const tocList = document.getElementById('toc-list');
    if (!content || !tocList) return;

    const headings = content.querySelectorAll('h2');
    
    headings.forEach((heading) => {
      if(!heading.id) return;
      const li = document.createElement('li');
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = '#' + heading.id;
      a.textContent = heading.textContent;
      a.className = 'toc-link';
      li.appendChild(a);
      tocList.appendChild(li);
    });

    const observerOptions = {
      root: null,
      rootMargin: '-100px 0px -60% 0px',
      threshold: 0
    };

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          const id = entry.target.getAttribute('id');
          document.querySelectorAll('.toc-link').forEach(link => {
            link.classList.remove('active');
            if (link.getAttribute('href') === '#' + id) {
              link.classList.add('active');
            }
          });
        }
      });
    }, observerOptions);

    headings.forEach(heading => observer.observe(heading));
  });
</script>
